okf_version: "1.0"
task: "Separate the Codex launch modes in the Launch menu (plain TUI / TUI + app-server / standalone app-server with no TUI) and switch Kobe (.14 u24) to TUI + app-server on its existing conversation."
reported: "User, 2026-10-04: Kobe looked frozen after choosing 'Codex app server' (screen ended at the app-server banner). '개선하고 코비세션이 추가해줘'. Clarified 'web' = the app-server's own ws/http endpoints, not Ciel Web Chat."
cause: "The menu item 'Codex app server' runs the bare server only: no conversation TUI, waiting for a JSON-RPC client. codex-remote (TUI attached to the app-server) existed only on the CLI (--ca-runtime codex-remote)."
changes:
  menu: "Launch rows: 'Codex (plain TUI)', 'Codex TUI + app-server' (new action launch-codex-remote, result code PRELAUNCH_LAUNCH_CODEX_REMOTE=16; existing codes unchanged), 'Codex app-server (standalone / no TUI)', 'Codex desktop app'. Plain TUI stays the default; remembered preference supports remote. Legacy menu (ciel-runtime-menu.py) gets the same choice."
  dispatch: "Claude/Codex/AGY/app-server launchers dispatch result 16 to the existing launch_codex_remote with the original passthrough (resume args kept), skip_menu=True, no second self-update. From remote/desktop, choosing standalone hands over to launch_codex_app_server so the bare session adapter (resume mapping, channel client) is kept."
  notice: "Bare server prints 'Standalone Codex app-server: no conversation TUI. Waiting for a WebSocket JSON-RPC client.' and the /readyz /healthz URLs labelled 'HTTP status (not a web chat UI)'. Condition is 'session has no launch_mode', so it shows for the real bare session adapter, not only desktop=None."
  launch_state: "Fixed operator precedence in run_codex_app_server record_launch_state_for_cwd: session_mode or (native label if native else 'codex-app-server-router'). Before, non-native remote/desktop launches lost their mode."
tests: "unit 1721 OK (skipped 49), router 1175 OK, channel 454 OK (skipped 80), runtime 366 OK (skipped 19); ruff clean; docs check clean; live router 9611 healthy. New/updated: launch rows and remembered default, remote dispatch from each launcher with exact resume args, remote->standalone handover, bare notice with endpoints, mode recording native/non-native."
real_cli (isolated config/CODEX_HOME, local):
  menu: "evidence/launch-menu-screen.txt: Launch summary 'Codex TUI · ... · Codex TUI + app-server · Codex app-server (no TUI)'; launch chooser rows Codex (plain TUI) / Codex TUI + app-server / Codex app-server (standalone / no TUI) / Codex desktop app."
  standalone: "evidence/standalone-notice-screen.txt: `cli --ca-runtime codex-app-server` printed the no-TUI notice and the status URLs; /readyz 200. The trailing 401 is the isolated CODEX_HOME having no login."
kobe (.14 u24, KOBE Ai, agent 24):
  method: "Commands typed into Kobe's own AAP web terminal (ws /api/aap/ws/agents/24/console?session=aap-agent-24, shell owned by aapw-a24u24, cwd ...\\u24\\home\\kobe-ai). SSH (SYSTEM) used only for read-only metadata. Package already installed: @one-ciel-ai/ciel-runtime 0.2.51-nightly.20261004-150433.fec18c1 (has codex-remote and resume mapping)."
  launch: "CIEL_RUNTIME_SKIP_MENU=1, CODEX_HOME=C:/Users/aapw-a24u24/.codex (existing), `ciel-runtime --ca-runtime codex-remote --ca-no-update-check --ca-no-self-update-check resume 00347d86-24f3-4ff3-b730-351604b415aa`. No DB/rollout edits."
  verified: "Processes under the Kobe terminal: codex app-server --listen ws://127.0.0.1:9799 with --ws-auth capability-token, and TUI codex --remote ws://127.0.0.1:9799 --remote-auth-token-env ... resume 00347d86-...; /readyz and /healthz 200; app-server.log under codex-remote/651d879f6c68. runtime-input-status: 43, 44, 45 queued -> submitted (<1 s) -> replied (16:03-16:04 local); cursor 45. Before the switch all 21 Kobe messages were failed prompt_not_submitted."
  not_verified: "Kobe's AAP session_restore_command is empty (read from /api/aap/agents), so an AAP recycle will not relaunch codex-remote by itself. The menu change (this release) is not on Kobe yet: Kobe runs fec18c1 and was switched via the CLI."
not_done: "Not committed, not pushed, not published (plan: no publish without a separate request)."
